.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt NQDSSE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nqdsse ,
.Nm nqdssevrfy
.Nd sign and check DSSE envelopes
.Sh LIBRARY
libnoqtis, \-lnoqtis
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In noqtis.h
.Ft int
.Fo nqdsse
.Fa "nqsalg alg" "const uint8_t *sk" "size_t sklen"
.Fa "const uint8_t *pk" "size_t pklen" "const char *type"
.Fa "const uint8_t *payload" "size_t n"
.Fa "char *out" "size_t cap" "size_t *outlen"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo nqdssevrfy
.Fa "nqsalg alg" "const uint8_t *pk" "size_t pklen"
.Fa "const char *env" "size_t n"
.Fa "uint8_t *payload" "size_t cap" "size_t *outlen" "char type[256]"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn nqdsse
writes to
.Fa out ,
of
.Fa cap
bytes, a DSSE envelope of the
.Fa n
payload bytes, signed with the key pair
.Fa sk , pk
of
.Fa alg
over the envelope's pre-authentication encoding
.Bd -literal -offset indent
"DSSEv1" SP LEN(type) SP type SP LEN(payload) SP payload
.Ed
.Pp
(lengths in ASCII decimal), as canonical JSON:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
{"payload":<base64>,"payloadType":<type>,
 "signatures":[{"keyid":<hex SHA-256 of pk>,"sig":<base64>}]}
.Ed
.Pp
.Fa type
is 1 to 255 printable ASCII bytes with no space, quote or backslash,
such as
.Ql application/vnd.in-toto+json .
The signature is checked before the envelope is written.
.Fa *outlen
gets the envelope's size, also when
.Fa cap
is too small.
.Pp
.Fn nqdssevrfy
checks the envelope
.Fa env
of
.Fa n
bytes: one of its signatures (at most 16) must verify under
.Fa pk
over the pre-authentication encoding of its
.Ql payloadType
and decoded
.Ql payload .
The payload then goes to
.Fa payload
.Pf ( Fa *outlen
its size, also when
.Fa cap
is too small) and, when
.Fa type
is not
.Dv NULL ,
the payload type to it, NUL-terminated.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Bl -tag -width NQEVRFY
.It Dv NQOK
Written, or checked.
.It Bq Er NQEBUF
.Fa cap
is too small.
.It Bq Er NQEVRFY
.Fn nqdssevrfy :
no signature verifies.
.It Bq Er NQEDEC
.Fn nqdssevrfy :
not an envelope.
.It Bq Er NQEARG
A
.Dv NULL
argument, keys of the wrong size or not a pair, or a type that is not
allowed.
.It Bq Er NQEMEM
The allocation hook returned
.Dv NULL .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis-export 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-verify 1 ,
.Xr nqsign 3
.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
.%T DSSE: Dead Simple Signing Envelope
.%U https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse/blob/master/envelope.md
.Re
